# Whitelist: only the lessons, scripts, small result files and the handoff notes are tracked.
# Models, GGUFs, data, stats, logs, .venv and llama.cpp stay local
# (rebuild with scripts/00_setup.sh, 01_download.sh and the numbered pipeline).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/learn/
!/scripts/
!/results/
# raw tensor dumps (6-328 MB): routers, routing traces, ablation tokens
/results/**/*.pt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
